; Maximum-width layout. PUSH widths and program counters shrink when values need fewer bytes.
    0x0: CODESIZE
    0x1: RETURNDATASIZE
    0x2: RETURNDATASIZE
    0x3: CODECOPY
    0x4: PUSH2     deploymentLength
